# gemini.agent - Google's Gemini CLI, an ALT mux agent to experiment with.
# Claude stays the mux default; select this per session with an `agent gemini`
# line in a layout (or `pane gemini` for one pane).
#
# `go` resumes the most recent session for the project (like claude --continue),
# falling back to a fresh one when there is none. Gemini has no interactive
# conversation PICKER (claude --resume opens one) -- its CLI resumes only by
# "latest" or an index -- so `resume` also continues the latest. To pick a
# specific one by hand: `gemini --list-sessions`, then `gemini -r <index>`.
# Install: the `gemini` command must be on PATH (@google/gemini-cli, via npm).
go      gemini -r latest || gemini
resume  gemini -r latest || gemini
